      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_01:1_5_048_01:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_01:1_5_048_01:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_01:1_5_048_01:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9984a1b601a8c86f96e80f04536560d04e33acef50ab3a372e337c0aa44f3d83",
      "text": "青春题材舞台剧的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_01:1_5_048_01:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d13e1e7a5948701966c2ed3f774a07143d2bc5da4bf8767e97b529e2052c15fd",
      "text": "“既然那么在乎那个女孩，\n早点去告白不就好了嘛”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_01:1_5_048_01:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0843fc296975ad6ce453ff45a87df2657b8e0542fddc29d8c5b7264223ace07",
      "text": "“真是的，拿你没办法呢。\n由我来给你创造机会吧”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_01:1_5_048_01:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ec8167697f4a8e17fa8f450995cd3eb4109987dae76644783f61b2507ea4514",
      "text": "“所以你一定要把心意传达过去哦？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_01:1_5_048_01:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:240ee017a970ede354572e72582a3443193726549169275feb97c98fefd9b5cf",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●P酱，感觉怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_01:1_5_048_01:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6ab52b0743d4f909c843fc28e415f6415a7da8c5d137a7d3c2dd4a7d92558f8",
      "text": "每多练习一次，表现就变得更好呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_01:1_5_048_01:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46619ada8a68df9d0f90034d2e9b379fd7c351bc384894420ddc997afa55f55a",
      "text": "刚才那句台词，\n也充满着担心朋友的心情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_01:1_5_048_01:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa36c9830a79f9d85697001e8f58a5da845a38d3ab502dfbacdca78dcec47840",
      "text": "真的吗？太好了。\n拿到台本之后，我有很认真地去揣摩角色哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_01:1_5_048_01:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bebc4719b400803b43265360781a974718b974f2756a56bf17e26ef3fc42569d",
      "text": "呐，我还想再练习一下。\n……能陪陪我吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_01:1_5_048_01:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ca1c6261281fb5fa75975246db6cd0e53313cd455dd4629953a59c6e85201ac",
      "text": "当然可以。\n我会奉陪到底的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_01:1_5_048_01:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b7d480b21207a1e62cdfffb66060d579f2ccd42464974ffb6a9653bcd785743",
      "text": "呵呵，谢谢你。\n请多关照哦，●●●●●●●●●●P酱♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
